OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny intervals and showers,
OL,6,Fthe showers quite heavy but passing
OL,7,Fthrough quickly. Best of the sunshine
OL,8,Ffor East Lothian and eastern Borders.
OL,9,FFresh to strong west or southwest
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers in the evening. Turning mostly
OL,14,Fdry in the east overnight but still a
OL,15,Ffew showers in the Southwest. Fresh to
OL,16,Fstrong winds gradually ease.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
