OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,6,Foccasional showers, these mainly in
OL,7,Fthe west while staying mostly dry in
OL,8,Fthe east. Winds will become light by
OL,9,Fafternoon. Patchy rain possible in
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,13,Fwith rain on Sunday morning and again
OL,14,Flater in the day. Bright start Monday
OL,15,Fthen increasingly heavy showers and
OL,16,Fstrong winds. Windy Tuesday with
OL,17,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
